Research Significance
---------------------
This section extends the MW–M31 merger pipeline beyond conventional
density-profile analysis into statistical dynamical-interaction
tracking. The framework is designed to study encounter-driven mixing,
relaxation processes, and gravitational scattering signatures during
the merger while remaining consistent with the collisionless nature
of dark matter in cosmological N-body simulations.
